Z||000000||danny boy||03-25-2001||02:51 PM|||| Last night I went into town in the GT.I was making laps getting ready to go home and change to meet some friends at a bar,when A Saturn pulled alongside at a light.I kinda know who it was but not really.The friend I was meeting was behind me so I revved up so he would know I knew he was there.The Saturn thought I wanted to run.Just for $hits and giggles I decided to go ahead,and to my surprise I won.By A LOT. Next light,Ran again.Won by a lot again. Then I went home,changed,came back to town and end up in another one.Blus Honda Accord.No stickers but big wing and goofy dual tips that stuck out way too far.Pulled a few carlengths on him easy.<BR>    I've always thought of my GT as the slowest,worst handling car on the road but now I'm getting a little Faith in it.||||reg||1
